      <Char_Desc_450>MOverlay - Master Page Tool [KZY] is a lightweight, efficient desktop utility designed to eliminate performance bottlenecks in Variable Data Printing (VDP).  It solves the challenge of combining a static &quot;master&quot; PDF background (containing heavy graphics) with a dynamic &quot;variable&quot; PDF containing changing elements-such as sequential numbering, names, or codes-across hundreds of pages without straining system resources.</Char_Desc_450>
